The simplest way to retrieve stuff from water in ANY version of nethack is to
just kick at the water.  the kickable stuff will fly out.  Usually, with
ghosts, the corpse of the dearly departed is on the bottom of the stack,
so once you get a "thud" you know you've pretty much moved everything.
	And, incidentally, the boulder trick indeed removes the water, but
it also makes all the stuff on that square disappear-at least, this was
my experience.  Haven't experimented with wizard mode in 3.1.3 to see if 
that's still true.



